1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,174
Tally agent Windows ke liye ek chhota sa desktop application hai.

2
00:00:04,174 --> 00:00:07,577
Downloads section se agent installer download kariye.

3
00:00:07,577 --> 00:00:10,916
Double click karke run kariye — Next, Next, Install.

4
00:00:10,916 --> 00:00:13,100
30 second mein install ho jaayega.

5
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:16,953
Icon system tray mein aa jaayega — right bottom corner mein.

6
00:00:16,953 --> 00:00:18,879
Right click karke Open kariye.

7
00:00:18,879 --> 00:00:23,053
Ek chhota window kholega — apna FLOWRA login credentials daaliye.

8
00:00:23,053 --> 00:00:24,453
Bas!

9
00:00:24,453 --> 00:00:29,012
Ab har raat 2 baje ye agent apne aap aapka Tally data cloud pe bhejega.

10
00:00:29,012 --> 00:00:30,888
Aapko kuch nahi karna — Tally chalu rakhen bas.
